   "locked": false,
   "text": "security rules (the last one is deny-all-log)\nenterprise-to-data, enterprise-to-oob, data-to-enterprise: any service\ninternet-to-inside-vips: tcp 80 / 443 / 6443 to 10.1.1.0/24\ndata-to-stor-mgmt: tcp 443, 10.1.1.0/24 > 10.1.20.0/24\nbastion-to-data, bastion-to-stor-mgmt: tcp 22 / 80 / 443 / 6443\ndata-, enterprise-, oob-, stor-mgmt-, bastion-to-internet",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "security rules (the last one is deny-all-log)\nenterprise-to-data, enterprise-to-oob, data-to-enterprise: any service\ninternet-to-inside-vips: tcp 80 / 443 / 6443 to 10.1.1.0/24\ndata-to-stor-mgmt: tcp 443, 10.1.1.0/24 > 10.1.20.0/24\nbastion-to-data, bastion-to-stor-mgmt: tcp 22 / 80 / 443 / 6443\ndata-, enterprise-, oob-, stor-mgmt-, bastion-to-internet",
