   "text": "bond0 (eth1 + eth2, LACP): VLAN 100, 10.1.1.37 - .52\nEth1/3-18 on fe-gpu-leaf3 and fe-gpu-leaf4, vPC 1-16\n8 rail NICs gpu0-gpu7 (eth4-eth11): NIC r > be-leaf r eth21-36, 172.16.r.27 - .42\nBMC NIC eth3 > oob-sw eth17-32, 10.1.2.37 - .52",
