   "text": "rail R: VLAN R x 10, 172.16.R.0/24, gateway .1 on vlan1.<R x 10>, bridged on its leaf (same rail never reaches a spine)   |   eBGP: spines AS 65200, leaf L AS 65200 + L\nnumbered /31 underlay 10.255.<spine>.x, BFD, 4-way ECMP, MTU 9198   |   pods: macvlan net-rail-0..7 on gpu0..gpu7, whereabouts .64 - .254, no routes: rails stay separate",
