   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Nexus: mgmt0 in VRF management, default route 172.21.21.1; the vPC\npeer-keepalive of each pair runs over mgmt0. Switches and firewall take\nNTP from 10.80.15.53 on their management ports. Access: ssh with the\noperator keys; kubectl from the bastion container.",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Nexus: mgmt0 in VRF management, default route 172.21.21.1; the vPC\npeer-keepalive of each pair runs over mgmt0. Switches and firewall take\nNTP from 10.80.15.53 on their management ports. Access: ssh with the\noperator keys; kubectl from the bastion container.",
